  FIT -->|fit result + revision| CTRL
  CTRL -->|atomic body + garment| PREVIEW
  CTRL -->|ready snapshot| EXPORT
  EXPORT -->|derived viewer artifact| CACHE
  CACHE -->|matching baked snapshot| VIEWER
  ASSETS -->|versioned rendering assets| VIEWER
